### REST controller : all accounts
GET http://localhost:8081/api/bankAccounts

### REST controller : one account (replace {{id}})
GET http://localhost:8081/api/bankAccounts/{{id}}

### REST controller : new account
POST http://localhost:8081/api/bankAccounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "balance": 45000,
  "currency": "MAD",
  "type": "SAVING_ACCOUNT"
}

### REST controller : update an account
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/bankAccounts/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "balance": 99000
}

### REST controller : delete an account
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/bankAccounts/{{id}}

### Spring Data REST : all accounts
GET http://localhost:8081/bankAccounts

### Spring Data REST : pagination
GET http://localhost:8081/bankAccounts?page=0&size=3

### Spring Data REST : projection p1 (id, type, balance)
GET http://localhost:8081/bankAccounts?projection=p1

### Spring Data REST : search by type
GET http://localhost:8081/bankAccounts/search/byType?t=CURRENT_ACCOUNT

### OpenAPI documentation
GET http://localhost:8081/v3/api-docs
